Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.78,0:00:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.08,0:00:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.02,0:00:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.32,0:00:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get what you really want.\NI want more. Any one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.94,0:00:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.20,0:00:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a wind, jump high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.88,0:00:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.79,0:00:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.46,0:00:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.92,0:00:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.88,0:00:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,oh, oh, oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.18,0:00:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.08,0:00:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,oh, oh
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.30,0:00:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it again. You know what I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.22,0:00:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby, no one can make my dream\Ncome true. Don't you feel it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't know what is Something\Nis testing me every day Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.94,0:01:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go. Let's fly away. I know\NI never wanna come back here. Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.16,0:01:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go. Let's fly away. The great\Nend of the unknown rules standing up,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.82,0:01:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,blowing up My dream is getting\Nwilder I'm not afraid, beat me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.98,0:01:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,hit me I will never\Nturn around Another day,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.24,0:01:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,another chance You know it's\Nnever too late If I can't do it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.54,0:01:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So can you? Only without
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.42,0:01:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your\Nlife. Party for tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.64,0:01:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,go get what you really want I want more,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.98,0:01:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,anyone more, come on, open up the door
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.16,0:01:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,it's your life Run like\Na wind, jump high, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.82,0:01:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah I know you're strong Believe you cannot\Nachieve your goal Let's keep on going,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.76,0:01:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Roaring. It's my life, it's your life.\NFighting for your eyes that I want,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.30,0:01:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but you're where it was.\NI want more, anyone more,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.72,0:01:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the gate. It's my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.96,0:02:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,it's your light, shine like a star\Nto be good I know you're strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.94,0:02:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust that you can't achieve your\Nbest. Let's keep on going. Out of date
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.62,0:02:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You make my day every day
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.88,0:02:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.96,0:02:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He saved Dressrosa just like\NKing Rick said he would.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.36,0:02:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to him, Dressrosa is free!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.14,0:03:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Gumball?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.20,0:03:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Gumball?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.11,0:03:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he's a lot more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.66,0:03:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.57,0:03:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear King\NRiku's speech? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.00,0:03:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the pirate they call Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.12,0:03:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.58,0:03:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.86,0:03:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.02,0:03:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw Luffy's face in the newspaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.10,0:03:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy looks way different.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.66,0:03:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So how can we be sure it's him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.06,0:03:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but are you Straw\NHat Luffy? Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.06,0:03:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard Straw Hat's a monster,\Nlike 26 feet tall. But this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.38,0:03:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't be more than 14 feet or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.12,0:03:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean he's a fake?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.82,0:03:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, bouncy boy, are you legit or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.02,0:03:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you still bouncing around?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.82,0:03:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you stop that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.10,0:04:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Viola Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.94,0:04:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it really. You're sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.44,0:04:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.35,0:04:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What a devastating blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.26,0:04:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way he survived such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.36,0:04:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.64,0:04:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Not enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.30,0:05:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The damn birdcage, it's still there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.82,0:05:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,One more, then you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.54,0:05:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for Kuma Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.16,0:05:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the matter? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.22,0:06:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Jaya Burgess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.78,0:06:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.24,0:06:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He landed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.62,0:06:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That I had no idea he could jump that far!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.12,0:06:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.26,0:06:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabo, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.36,0:06:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, pick up—it looks like\NStraw Hats at the end of his rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.80,0:06:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.60,0:06:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I know
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.60,0:06:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,that guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.94,0:06:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He's
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.24,0:06:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,the captain of the first ship of\NEmperor Blackbeard's pirate group;
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.76,0:06:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,they call him Champ Burgess!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.72,0:06:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got something,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.86,0:06:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and I want it—which means you're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.82,0:06:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The Gum-Gum fruit is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.90,0:06:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.62,0:07:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.53,0:07:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't get too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.74,0:07:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still a pirate—remember,\Nand pirates shouldn't be trusted!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.38,0:07:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows what he's gonna do next?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.44,0:07:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But how can you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.58,0:07:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He beat Doflamingo if not for him,\Nthe whole kingdom would be done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.76,0:07:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.67,0:07:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.59,0:07:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy isn't going to\Nhurt us! I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.10,0:07:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't trust him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.90,0:07:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget King Rick said that straw\Nhat Luffy would be the one to save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.42,0:07:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.33,0:07:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell us man!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.25,0:07:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This was the battle over now or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.78,0:07:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What about dopamine?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.69,0:07:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,what about dopamine Domingo, is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.84,0:08:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no good!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.24,0:08:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.64,0:08:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get away from town!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.60,0:08:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two fires aren't\Ndone taking it out yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.22,0:08:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Even downtown isn't safe, Val!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.06,0:08:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then where the hell do we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.22,0:08:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The birdcage is closing in!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.56,0:08:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere left to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.22,0:08:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.18,0:09:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.04,0:09:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.30,0:10:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.52,0:10:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think he can go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.34,0:10:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If you turn back, you'll\Ndie along with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.86,0:10:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.12,0:10:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the pirate sort it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.82,0:10:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.88,0:10:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you recognize me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.96,0:10:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Gyat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.28,0:10:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,From the tournament!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.20,0:10:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.34,0:10:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That mysterious warrior named Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.94,0:10:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It was you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.74,0:11:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.65,0:11:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha! It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.14,0:11:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,For one so small, you've\Ngot serious strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.50,0:11:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo's about to strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.74,0:11:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, what's your next move?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.00,0:11:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anything I\Ncan do to help you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.84,0:11:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Buy me ten minutes. Hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.06,0:11:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,After I use Bounce Man, I have to\Nwait ten minutes to recharge my Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.66,0:11:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Bounce Man? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.24,0:11:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what\NDoflamingo's next move is,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.48,0:11:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm pretty much useless right\Nnow, so I gotta stay away from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.06,0:11:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Once my Haki comes back,\NI'll give him one good punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.16,0:11:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and that'll be the end of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.86,0:11:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.14,0:11:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If I make that happen,\Nwe're free from this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.00,0:11:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.10,0:12:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,do you really think in ten minutes you can
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.72,0:12:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,beat Doflamingo and get\Nrid of the birdcage?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.88,0:12:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.02,0:12:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.64,0:12:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.34,0:12:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.54,0:12:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you men work with that? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.86,0:12:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.18,0:12:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll go by faster than\Nthe blink of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.62,0:12:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.86,0:12:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,After you rest up, you can\Nreally suck at Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.84,0:12:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us handle the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.32,0:13:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are all the other\Ncompetitors from the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.50,0:13:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the same people who\Nweren't willing to help you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.02,0:13:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive us, Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.38,0:13:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't have gotten so\Ndistracted by the bounty on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.38,0:13:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we didn't know you'd give\NJoe Flamingo a run for his money.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.76,0:13:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.02,0:13:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,As an apology, we'll put our\Nlives on the line to help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.58,0:13:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry if we beat him\Nbefore you get a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.54,0:13:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess we can finally give\Nyou a proper thank you, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.46,0:13:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavenly Demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.58,0:13:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a lot to say, so\Nthis could take a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.48,0:14:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He's looking for a fight, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.62,0:14:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.16,0:14:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, now's our chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.32,0:14:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The other half of you\Nfollow my lead! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.12,0:14:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Out! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.76,0:14:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.06,0:14:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad! I've gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.72,0:14:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.84,0:14:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Not this guy again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.56,0:14:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sabo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.46,0:15:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, isn't that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.22,0:15:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's one of the three stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.38,0:15:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.72,0:15:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The Revolutionary Army's Chief of Staff!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.72,0:15:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm everything you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.52,0:15:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And I came here to save\Nmy brother, Luffy. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.30,0:15:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, what is it you\Nwant with him, Burgess?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.40,0:15:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.78,0:15:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.30,0:15:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder why that ring's a bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.86,0:15:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Firefist Ace said it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.92,0:15:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He's our brother, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.96,0:15:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.24,0:15:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,After the battle on Bonnaroo Island,\NYou blackbeard pirates took Ace captive,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.56,0:16:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and that ended up being the catalyst\Nfor that terrible battle in Marineford.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.08,0:16:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace made his own choice, so I\Nwon't blame you for what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.42,0:16:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll be watching Luffy's\Nback from here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.60,0:16:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.36,0:16:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I care about\Nyour little brotherly bond?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.84,0:16:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Or about you or the\NRevolutionary Army's plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.64,0:16:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is between me and him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.64,0:16:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you and him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.44,0:16:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.86,0:16:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.92,0:16:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.98,0:16:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That was you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.10,0:16:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.01,0:16:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He ate it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.74,0:16:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.98,0:16:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I can't do more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.66,0:16:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo's on his way over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.26,0:17:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm gonna have my hands\Npretty full with this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.34,0:17:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.38,0:17:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ketz and those other dudes said\Nthey'd buy more time for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.12,0:17:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The name's Ketz.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.06,0:17:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I can take care of Mingo, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.50,0:17:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're the man with\Nthe plan, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.54,0:17:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Then leave this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.70,0:17:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabo, Ace's fruit, you ate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.44,0:17:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I couldn't give it up,\Ncould I? It was our brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.00,0:17:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah good thinking that\Nability's gonna be my little man
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.24,0:17:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep him safe. Pets. My name's\NGuts, but I got him. Whee-ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.42,0:17:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Galleon Lariat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.58,0:18:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now burning dragon claw fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.84,0:18:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.18,0:18:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And flame Dragon King!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.48,0:18:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But I just lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.38,0:18:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy works for one\Nof the four emperors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.80,0:18:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but Sabo, that guy's\Na big-shot revolutionary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.68,0:18:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as he saw the\NFlame Power Fruit's power,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.68,0:18:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,he turned all of his attention to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.36,0:18:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that means the rumors were true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.56,0:18:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Burgess is hunting down people\Nwho possess Devil Fruit abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.50,0:19:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.70,0:19:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.22,0:19:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you won the competition\Nand got the Flame Flame Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.38,0:19:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy in the last round wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.66,0:19:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to go somewhere, so\NSabo fought in my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.78,0:19:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a blatant violation of tournament\Nrules, but I suppose it all worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.44,0:19:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, taking over your deceased\Nbrother's ability was a noble goal indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.98,0:19:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.89,0:19:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,giving you a chance to recover\Nand overthrow Doflamingo
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.02,0:19:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,is the only hope our kingdom\Nhas left at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.38,0:19:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.00,0:19:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.56,0:19:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.86,0:19:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.08,0:19:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.74,0:20:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been wearing him down, but\Nhe's still got so much strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.62,0:20:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.74,0:20:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to keep stalling him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.42,0:20:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.48,0:20:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I could kill the lot of you with my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.52,0:20:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,closed if I didn't have\Nmore important business.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.90,0:20:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come and face me, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.56,0:20:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you regret this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.26,0:20:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I said face me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.54,0:20:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I think the wood wants us dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.76,0:20:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe we used\Nto light that maniac.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.88,0:20:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The birdcage wasn't enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.02,0:20:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's gonna turn the whole\Ntown into killer strings?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.70,0:21:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we live, Triss Rosa is done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.80,0:21:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about the buildings and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.98,0:21:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't get clear of\Ndowntown, we're all gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.76,0:21:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The kingdom is like a\Nbattlefield everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.14,0:21:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're running out of places to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.44,0:21:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I ain't dying because of a\Nbunch of stupid strings, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.40,0:21:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got to be safe downtown, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.46,0:21:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop showing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.30,0:21:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Back off, you're going to crush me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.28,0:21:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I have children, watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.16,0:21:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, stop right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.76,0:21:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why are you running this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.92,0:21:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Downtown is the only safe place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.96,0:21:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No, downtown is a battlefield, man. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.46,0:21:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And then we're stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.52,0:21:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell are we supposed to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.22,0:21:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, King Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.02,0:22:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The kingdom is dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.18,0:22:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you help us somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.72,0:22:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes. Armament.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.18,0:22:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think your swords can\Nstop the cage's movement, Sir Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.94,0:22:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't something that\Ncan simply be pushed back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.84,0:22:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.60,0:22:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather than telling me that\Ncan't be done, how about you try?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.90,0:22:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to die whining?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.90,0:22:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,At the end of the day, this\Nis just one man's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.68,0:22:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So there's no reason to believe that I\Ncan't stop it your friend speaks the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.84,0:22:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.04,0:23:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys ready to go
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.80,0:23:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Factory is seen. Prism stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.92,0:23:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't get shredded.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.24,0:23:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So I want you bros to push it\Nwith everything you've got Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.50,0:23:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,On up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.44,0:23:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, it's go time, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.84,0:23:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatcha gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.36,0:23:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I said, whatcha gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.22,0:23:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.84,0:23:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Zora's pushing the birdcage, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.82,0:23:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You think it could be stopped?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.98,0:23:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.28,0:23:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd never even really\Nconsidered it quite honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.90,0:23:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, let's wish him luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.88,0:24:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just doing what the\Nyoung master would want!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.70,0:24:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.61,0:24:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.53,0:24:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.44,0:24:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.76,0:24:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaku, punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.36,0:24:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You stay down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.04,0:24:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the new King's Plateau!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.38,0:24:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're not in the Don Quixote family,\Nthen you weren't allowed to be here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.98,0:24:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The executives all got their asses kicked!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.12,0:24:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no family!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.08,0:24:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't keep the safest place\Nin the kingdom all to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.16,0:24:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.86,0:24:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you are condemned criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.32,0:24:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The young master has\Ndecided that the kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.54,0:24:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,will be rebuilt from the\Nground up without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.22,0:24:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Barrier, barrier, pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.24,0:24:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sucking.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.56,0:25:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your old news, this\Nain't your turf no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.28,0:25:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The Coliseum Fighters are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.02,0:25:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,More to Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.24,0:25:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi Rudin.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.00,0:25:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cheat, Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.50,0:25:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Commander Kiros is here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.28,0:25:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I able to move again? It's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.68,0:25:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I was injured quite badly,\Nbut I feel fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.94,0:25:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You should make the most\Nof it while you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.58,0:25:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a life support procedure that
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.52,0:25:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Monchery has\Nused on all of Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.28,0:25:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.56,0:25:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by life support?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.16,0:25:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Details can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.58,0:25:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make our way to the plateau.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.62,0:25:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.53,0:25:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The center of the birdcage\Nis moving this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.00,0:25:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.16,0:26:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for saving us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.34,0:26:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.32,0:26:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't be lazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.94,0:26:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We still need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.12,0:26:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If any of you've got muscle,\Nwe'll accept you with open arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.80,0:26:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.71,0:26:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,With open arms, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.28,0:26:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.06,0:26:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not done yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.30,0:26:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to come and play,\NI'll just have to drag you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.36,0:26:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, no way. Wait a second.\NIs it speeding up? It's
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.66,0:26:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,gotta be we've got If we\Nhad it bad enough already,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.34,0:26:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,how are we supposed to outrun it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.60,0:27:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, King Rick, we're counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.42,0:27:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't keep this up!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.90,0:27:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, spare them!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.94,0:27:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dead for it! Don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.28,0:27:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Put your backs into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.64,0:27:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't for lift!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.52,0:27:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.62,0:27:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Push through!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.60,0:27:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.06,0:27:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm losing ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.90,0:27:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it's speeding\Nup, you guys got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.96,0:27:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep pushing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.08,0:27:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Make those strings cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.98,0:27:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, push!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.46,0:28:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Push!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.64,0:28:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, this is our\Nchance to show off. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.90,0:28:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't find you, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.18,0:28:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't anybody help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.20,0:28:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on our own!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.22,0:28:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We just gotta keep running for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.24,0:28:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Only three minutes remain until\Nthe birdcage reaches downtown,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.80,0:28:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,at which point the citizens of\NDressrosa will be wiped out completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.58,0:28:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.10,0:28:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We're never gonna make it at this rate!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.78,0:28:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Four minutes remain until\NLuffy can use his Haki again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.78,0:28:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.80,0:28:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,the other fighters in Dressrosa\Nmust find a way to make up their
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.48,0:28:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,one-minute difference before the\Nbirdcage finishes contracting.
